@prefix eco:<https://ggen.dev/ecosystem#>. @prefix skos:<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>.
eco:ClosureExactLocks a eco:GovernanceInvariant,skos:Concept;skos:prefLabel "closure binds exact locks";skos:definition "Dependency closure and external identity locking are distinct but both required for reproducible manufacture.";eco:falsifier "A dependency-closed profile with floating external identities falsifies reproducibility.".
